SUMMARY:Craggy!
DESCRIPTION:The Asheville Hiking Group\nWe'll start at Graybeard Overlook 
 (BRP) and hike on the MST past the Douglas Falls trail\, then beyond the V
 isitor Center\, then take the side trail to the Craggy Gardens overlook\, 
 and then have our break at the gazebo\, which is our turn around. About 7 
 miles out and back on the MST. Craggy trails: rocky with uneven terrain. P
 ace approximately 2 mph\, at times slower.\n\nNot a dog friendly hike.\n\n
 **Optional car pool:** Meet at Folk Art Center\, **lower parking level** a
 t **8:00**. Trailhead at 8:30.\n\n**RELEASE OF LIABILITY:** The organizer 
 of this trip is a volunteer and not a professional guide. The function of 
 the organizer is only to organize this trip. If you sign up or participate
  in this event you acknowledge that you freely and voluntarily agree to as
 sume all risks of injuries\, illnesses\, and damages arising from\, as a r
 esult of\, and associated with this event. In addition\, you acknowledge t
 hat you agree to the Meetup Terms of Service: [https://help.meetup.com/hc/
 en-us/articles/360027447252-Terms-of-Service#h_9e385395-a405-4361-8afc-854
 a4f586c82.](https://help.meetup.com/hc/en-us/articles/360027447252-Terms-o
 f-Service#h_9e385395-a405-4361-8afc-854a4f586c82.)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/ashevillehikinggroup/events/316339164
 /
